          teachingResources: "Realia (farm tools and implements such as cutlass, hoe, hook and line, burdizzo, etc); Videos/pictures on Agricultural mechanisation; Computer; Projector; Pen; Notebook; Textbooks in Agricultural mechanisation and power; Wellington boots; Hand gloves; Nose mask; Hat; Hammer; Knapsack sprayer; First aid box; Bandage; Gauze; Alcohol; Water; Ointment; Tourniquet; Thermal Blanket; Antiseptic Wash; Pair of scissors; Bandages and knuckle bandages; Adhesive bandage; Ice packs; Eye wash; Pictures or video/pictures of Agriculture machines and implements such as tractor, combined harvester, feed mill machines, bowl chopper, plough, harrow, rigger, planter, harvester etc.; Pictures/videos on the operation and maintenance of Agricultural machines and implements such as tractor, combined harvester, feed mill machines, bowl chopper, plough, harrow, ridger, planter, harvester etc. Realia (mist blower, knapsack sprayer, lawn mower etc.)"
